<title>USA: CNB Financial sets special div of $0.12.</title>
<headline>CNB Financial sets special div of $0.12.</headline>
<dateline>CANAJOHARIE, N.Y. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>CNB Financial Corp said on Monday its board approved a special dividend of $0.12 per share, to be paid in addition to the regular fourth quarter dividend of $0.17 per share.</p>
<p>This dividend payment will bring the year-to-date dividends to $0.79 per share, compared with $0.72 for 1995.</p>
</text>
